  "prefLabel": "He-P 4071.05 Exemptions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4071.05 Exemptions. The following wastes shall not be subject to the generator fees collected under He-P 4071.03(a):\n\n(a) Radioactive material transferred to an authorized recipient as provided in He-P 4030.16, other than a licensed low-level radioactive waste disposal site; and\n\n(b) Radioactive waste disposed of in accordance with He-P 4023.\n\nPARTS He-P 4072 – He-P 4089 Reserved",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p4062-4097.html"
